    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuild? how? you dont get it. the person who was capable of that life is dead. everyone knows. i see it in the way my old colleagues won't even return a text. it's not just a setback, it's a total erasure. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person staring back. it's like the world has already moved on and just left a void where i used to be. it feels so permanent.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
