      "content": "it's just not that simple. talking to a hotline doesn't change the fact that my reputation is ash. there is no \"new life\" when your name alone makes people turn away. it's like there's no point in even trying to exist in a world where you've been fundamentally deleted. sometimes it feels like the most logical thing is to just stop fighting a battle that's already been lost. like, why stay when there's nothing left to hold onto?",
